      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cv-text",
              "name": "cv_text",
              "value": "=# [Your Name]\n## AI/ML Engineer | Automation Specialist\n\n### Professional Summary\nExperienced AI/ML Engineer with 5+ years building intelligent automation systems, workflow orchestration platforms, and AI agents. Expert in LangChain, n8n, OpenAI APIs, and full-stack development. Proven track record of architecting scalable solutions and leading technical teams.\n\n### Technical Skills\n- **AI/ML**: LangChain, OpenAI API, GPT-4, Vector Databases, RAG Systems\n- **Automation**: n8n, Zapier, Make, Custom Workflow Engines\n- **Languages**: Python, JavaScript/TypeScript, Node.js, SQL\n- **Frameworks**: React, Next.js, FastAPI, Express\n- **Tools**: Docker, Git, PostgreSQL, Redis, AWS\n\n### Professional Experience\n\n**Senior AI Engineer** | TechCorp | 2022-Present\n- Built AI-powered workflow automation platform serving 10k+ users\n- Designed and implemented LangChain-based agent systems\n- Reduced manual processing time by 80% through intelligent automation\n- Led team of 5 engineers in developing microservices architecture\n\n**Automation Engineer** | StartupXYZ | 2020-2022\n- Developed custom n8n nodes and integrations for enterprise clients\n- Created AI agents for customer support, reducing response time by 60%\n- Implemented CI/CD pipelines and automated deployment workflows\n\n### Education\n**BS Computer Science** | University Name | 2019\n\n### Certifications\n- AWS Certified Solutions Architect\n- OpenAI API Specialist",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cv-public-url",
              "name": "cv_public_url",
              "value": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_CV_FILE_ID/view?usp=sharing",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cover-letter-template-id",
              "name": "cover_letter_template_docId",
              "value": "={{$env.COVER_LETTER_TEMPLATE_ID}}",
              "type": "string"
